            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nani-ke nina baseFilipi niyazi ukuthi ekuqaleni kwevangeli, ekusukeni kwami eMakedoniya, akukho bandla elahlanganyela nami endabeni yokupha nokwamukela, kuphela nina nodwa.",
          "type": "text",
